{"unit_id":"tag:03OW:proof","translation":"选取内射（injective）消解（resolution）<MATH_0001>，它在 <MATH_0002> 中，并考虑双复形（double complex）\n<MATH_0003>\n及映射（maps）\n<MATH_0004>。这里的水平（horizontal）映射（map）是自然映射（natural map）\n<MATH_0005>，指向左列，而垂直映射（map）由 <MATH_0006> 诱导，并落在底行。根据假设，<MATH_0007> 是由内射对象（injectives）组成的复形（complex），位于 <MATH_0008> 中，因此由引理 <REF_0001>，它是由内射对象（injectives）组成的复形（complex），位于 <MATH_0009> 中。因而双复形（double complex）的各行在正次数（degrees）上正合（exact）（引理 <REF_0002>），而核（kernel），对于 <MATH_0010>，等于 <MATH_0011>，因为 <MATH_0012> 是由层（sheaves）组成的复形（complex）。特别地，上同调（cohomology），对于全（total）复形（complex），是标准的上同调（cohomology），对应于整体截面（global sections）函子（functor）<MATH_0013>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n对于垂直方向，第 <MATH_0014> 个上同调（cohomology）群（group），在第 <MATH_0015> 列中，是\n<MATH_0016>，位于项 <MATH_0017>。所以这是标准的双复形（double complex）谱序列（spectral sequence），而 <MATH_0018>-页（page）如所指定。更多细节见景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）引理 <REF_0003>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"消解"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"natural map","target_term":"自然映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"垂直映射"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"double complex","target_term":"双复形"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"正次数"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"total","target_term":"全"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"global sections","target