{"unit_id":"tag:03X7:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是我们将讨论的拓扑（topologies）之一。因此 <MATH_0003>。当然，如果你只关注平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology），那么始终只需假设 <MATH_0004>。此外，我们将更详细地讨论平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphisms）、平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（coverings）和平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）景（sites），从节 <REF_0001> 开始。为继续讨论上同调（cohomology），对于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves），方便的做法是引入大（big）<MATH_0005>-景（site），以及在情形 <MATH_0006> 下引入小（small）<MATH_0007>-景（site），它们属于 <MATH_0008>。为此，我们先引入 <MATH_0009>-覆盖（covering）的概念。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term"