{"unit_id":"tag:03X8:statement","translation":"（见拓扑（Topologies）定义 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004> 和 <REF_0005>。）设 <MATH_0001>。一个态射族（family of morphisms），在概形（schemes）之间，记为 <MATH_0002>，具有固定目标，称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0003>-覆盖（covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，当且仅当每个 <MATH_0004> 分别是平坦（flat）的且为有限表示（finite presentation）、句法（syntomic）的、光滑（smooth）的、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的，或<SPACE_0001>开浸入（open immersion），并且有 <MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03X7:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n类（class），由所有 <MATH_0001>-覆盖（coverings）组成，满足定义 <REF_0001> 的公理（1）、（2）和（3）（即我们对景（site）的定义），见拓扑（Topologies）引理 <REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005> 和 <REF_0006>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们来引入将使用的景（sites）。与 <REF_0007> 中的做法相反，我们不打算选取论域（universe）。我们选取一个“部分（partial）论域（universe）”（它是适当大（large）的集合（set），如集合论（Sets）节 <REF_0008> 中那样），并考虑包含在这一集合（set）中的所有概形（schemes）。当然，我们确保所关心的基概形（base scheme）<MATH_0002> 包含在该部分（partial）论域（universe）中。选定底层范畴（underlying category）后，我们选取适当大（large）的集合（set），其元素是 <MATH_0003>-覆盖（coverings），使之成为景（site）。细节见关于拓扑（topologies）的章节，涉及概形（schemes）；选取时有很大的自由，但最终实际选取不会影响平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）（或其他）上同调（cohomology），对于 <MATH_0004>（正如 <REF_0009> 中，实际选取论域（universe）最终无关紧要）。此外，按本文的写法，愿意使用强不可达（strongly inaccessible）基数（cardinals）（即论域（universes））的读者可以用它们作为替代。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域"},{"source_term":"partial","target_term":"部分"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形"},{"source_term":"partial","target_term":"部分"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域"},{"source_term":"strongly inaccessible","target_term":"强不可达"},{"source_term":"cardinals","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"universes","target_term":"论域"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"论域","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"partial","target_term":"部分","context":"部分论域的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"大","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"strongly inaccessible","target_term":"强不可达","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"cardinals","target_term":"基数","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"universes","target_term":"论域","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03XB:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 一个 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>大（big）<MATH_0003>-景（site），属于 <MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是任意一个景（sites）<MATH_0005>，按上文所述构造，更详细的说明见拓扑（Topologies）定义 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004> 和 <REF_0005>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 如果 <MATH_0006>，则 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>小（small）<MATH_0007>-景（site），属于 <MATH_0008><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，是全子范畴（full subcategory）<MATH_0009>，在 <MATH_0010> 中，其对象（objects）是概形（schemes）<MATH_0011>，位于 <MATH_0012> 上，其结构态射（structure morphism）<MATH_0013> 分别是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的或<SPACE_0001>开浸入（open immersion）。一个覆盖（covering），在 <MATH_0014> 中，是覆盖（covering）<MATH_0015>，在 <MATH_0016> 中，并满足 <MATH_0017> 是 <MATH_0018> 的对象（object）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"structure morphism","target_term":"结构态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"所定义大景的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"所定义小景的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子